        {
          "type": "SD",
          "path": ".agdf/control/artefacts/agdf-begleiter-companion-20261025-01/SD.md",
          "digest": "sha256:d399bd56461113eeb81038ab8289a54af513eb16612b8dfdfb246acadea1a5c7",
          "statement": "- SDD-01: Wire the companion only through the runtime-profile Claude manifest: `definition.claude.hooks: \"./companion/hooks.json\"` projected by `createClaudePluginManifest` (runtime profile only); `companion/hooks.json` declares `{ \"modules\": [\"./register.mjs\"] }`; the source manifest declares none, as for `mcpServers`; rationale: the probe proved manifest-referenced modules load and merge with `hooks/hooks.json`, so the shared file and Codex hook trust stay untouched; consequence: companion files are physically present but inert in the Codex view of the shared runtime folder.",
          "intended_change": "Declare the companion hooks file only through the runtime-profile Claude manifest projection from a Claude companion descriptor, not through the shared plugin definition.",
          "reason": "The shared definition ships in the Copilot payload (BA-F01)."
        },
        {
          "type": "TP",
          "path": ".agdf/control/artefacts/agdf-begleiter-companion-20261025-01/TP.md",
          "digest": "sha256:4e77ce3739f390f5d28e3392432107074542c7aab2c91c5a89e20337cd988233",
          "statement": "| T-002 | Plugin definition and manifest projection: add `claude.hooks: \"./companion/hooks.json\"` to `plugins/agdf/meta/agdf-plugin.definition.json`; project it in `createClaudePluginManifest` for the runtime profile only; update `packages/cli/scripts/public-plugin-test.js` | Claude Code implementing agent | T-001 |",
          "intended_change": "Implement the declaration in the manifest projection from the Claude companion descriptor; leave plugins/agdf/meta/agdf-plugin.definition.json unchanged.",
          "reason": "Follows the corrected SDD-01."
        }
      ],
